According to Regulation 2024/1252, the materials that are classified as critical are:

* Critical materials listed in Annex I of the regulation;
* Materials used in the production of certain products, such as firearms and explosives;
* Materials used in the development of advanced technologies, such as quantum computing and artificial intelligence.

Please note that this information is based solely on the provided context.

